{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id101240944"}, "name":{"label":"CodeHole"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2013-08-11T22:17:09-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"1.2.0"}, "id":{"label":"852583141"}, "title":{"label":"It Works"}, "content":{"label":"I have been with Focus At Will since it was in Beta.  Its unique take on music to work by works for me.  I have tried using Pandora but never got the mix quite right.  F@W nails it.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=638810714&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id142918994"}, "name":{"label":"Crystal LM"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2013-08-10T21:54:25-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"1.2.0"}, "id":{"label":"852009465"}, "title":{"label":"IT WORKS"}, "content":{"label":"I use the web service, and now the app, all the time at work. If you are in the mode to work hard and get stuff done this app will focus you're efforts on the task(s) at hand. It's not obtrusive like listening to the radio where you slowly find your mind wandering or singing along. This ambient but noticeable music will keep the \"back\" of your mind occupied while you focus your attention on your work. I can get double the amount of emails done now and have time left over for side projects!", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=638810714&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"1"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"1"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id72004662"}, "name":{"label":"Jamanic"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2013-07-02T20:08:29-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"3"}, "im:version":{"label":"1.1.0"}, "id":{"label":"830388763"}, "title":{"label":"Really Does Help Focus"}, "content":{"label":"Update:  The App stability has deteriorated badly.  It is virtually unusable as a focus aid despite the neuroscience.  I purchased a one year subscription and will cancel if it can not be fixed soon.  The company did reach out and were very professional and concerned with fixing the problems.  I assume they are working on fixing, but it needs a patch and some redesign quickly.  I can not even listen to a 100 minute session without it disconnecting midway about 50% of the time.  Productivity tracker no longer works.\n\nBest focus app I have ever tried, but the App itself is too buggy.  Crashes, stops playing, productivity tracker  does not initiate after session ends.  Also, does not multitask well: If you are using another app while it is playing, it will not initiate the productivity tracker after the session ends, and sometimes the session will end before the time setting for the session. Also, very annoying start up not on landscape mode. Can change to landscape mode only after the player connects with the music service, and then you have to turn your iPad up and down several times before it finally sets in landscape mode. Once all of these bugs are fixed, it will really be a great attention, focus app. I did buy a subscription because the music sessions really helps me focus and concentrate. Can use a little more variety for each genre.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=638810714&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id193257529"}, "name":{"label":"A Casual User"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2013-06-27T00:20:54-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"4"}, "im:version":{"label":"1.1.0"}, "id":{"label":"827247488"}, "title":{"label":"Nice background music for work"}, "content":{"label":"I don't care if there is actually any science behind it, but it's good at block out disturbance without introduce new ones. However, after a while I feel too much repetitions. You definitely need more tracks.\nIn addition, it would be much better if you can change the iPhone lock screen image like other music apps.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=638810714&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id17032505"}, "name":{"label":"Brendan Herger"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2013-06-15T11:32:54-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"3"}, "im:version":{"label":"1.1.0"}, "id":{"label":"821117629"}, "title":{"label":"Great potential, poor implementation"}, "content":{"label":"The music offered is great, and there are many extra features which would be nice additions, but the program fails to load music or crashes so frequently that the benefits barely out weigh the inconvenience. \n\nI still use it daily, but am anxiously awaiting a more stable release.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=638810714&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
